        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Escudo. Bastiodon bloqueia praticamente qualquer ataque usando a frente do corpo, mas fica vulnerável quando é atingido por trás. Em grupo, vários deles se alinham lado a lado com os rostos voltados para o inimigo.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 11 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Bastiodon é a evolução final de Shieldon.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Block, Metal Sound, Protect, Tackle, Taunt, Wide Guard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Iron Defense</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Ancient Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Metal Burst</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Heavy Slam, Iron Head</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Avalanche, Blizzard, Block, Body Press, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Confide, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Flamethrower, Flash Cannon, Focus Energy, Foul Play, Frustration, Giga Impact, Hard Press, Heavy Slam, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Ice Beam, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Magic Coat, Magnet Rise, Metal Sound, Meteor Beam, Mud- Slap, Outrage, Power Gem, Power Shift, Protect, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Reversal, Roar, Rock Blast, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Scorching Sands, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Stealth Rock, Steel Beam, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thunder, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze</p>",
